      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "63c6e8750a908440c811ad60",
      "mergedPostDetails": "# Steps to reproduce\n\nReceive an invite to a group. Click \"Block[...]\" button on the notification.\n\n# Problems\n\n1)There's no way/UI to unblock a group for it to resend you invites.\n\n2)You still can click on \"join\"/\"request to join\" in the group view (if it's not private) but:\n\na) in game - nothing happens, and group owner doesn't receive the request\n\nb) on website - page crashes and server responds with 409 (screenshot)\n\n# Expected behaviors\n\n1) Being able to unblock a group in some way. There should be an UI for it.\n\n2) You shouldn't still be able to click \"join\"/\"request\" to a blocked group.\n\na) These buttons should be disabled for blocked groups.\n\nb) The website shouldn't crash.\n\n# This effectively makes you unable to join or request to the group EVER AGAIN",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Cannot unblock group and thus ever join or request to it ever again",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "638b517cee0ec47d3aede065",
